Copyright (C) Battle-Conquest

This mod is derived from unicum.gg-mod, by unicum-gg and its contributors:
https://github.com/unicum-gg/unicum.gg-mod

It keeps that project's battle capture (reading a battle's results in the
client, asking the server for the battles whose results screen was never
opened, queueing and sending them), its hot reload harness and its test suite,
and removes everything else. The history of every file it kept is in this
repository's git log.

Both are licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3: see
LICENSE.

When they are installed, the mod's settings page uses two mods by other
authors, which it neither contains nor ships:

  modsSettingsApi, by izeberg      https://github.com/izeberg/modssettingsapi
  modsListApi, by poliroid         https://gitlab.com/wot-public-mods/mods-list

The isolated garage bitmap font is generated from DejaVu Sans 2.37.
Bitstream copyright and trademark notices, the redistribution permission and
the public-domain notice for DejaVu changes ship alongside the generated
font in res/system/fonts/battle_conquest/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt.
Source: https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/
